arXiv:2611.17494v1 Announce Type: new 
Abstract: Let $RD_{\ell,t}^k(n)$ enumerates the number of $k$-colored simultaneously $l$-regular and $t$-distinct partitions. In this article, we establish some new infinite families of congruences modulo prime $p$, $p\geq5$ and modulo powers of 5 for $RD_{\ell,t}^k(n)$. For instance, for each $n\geq0$, $0\leq\alpha\leq{2k-2}$ and $k\geq1$,
  \begin{align*}
  \sum_{n=0}^{\infty}RD_{(5^{2k-1},5^{2k-1})}^2\big(5^{2k+\alpha-1}n+\frac{9\cdot5^{2k+\alpha-1}-2\cdot5^{2k-1}+1}{12}\big)q^n\equiv& 0\pmod{5^{k+\left[\frac{\alpha}{2}\right]}}
  \end{align*}
